-- REFUSE_TARGET_SECRET (S9 P4, PLAN O4; the text of cairn-lang
-- test/ir/secret-key.lang): zkKey on a run-time n. The ES build refuses it
-- with REFUSE_TARGET_SECRET. The Wasm build refuses it with REFUSE_LOWER (a
-- run-time zk operation has no host form).
def leakKey : (n : Nat) -> U256 := fun (n : Nat) => zkKey n
